      "value": "Steps to reproduce this bug:\n\n1. Have the SteamVR dash open\n\n2. Click on the canvas of the VRChat window on your desktop (either directly or via the SteamVR desktop overlay)\n\nVideo demonstration:\nhttps://youtu.be/56Q1O5s3KN0",
